       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60402.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60402.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Criar Nova Reconciliação                                   *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      *
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60402         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6040.
       COPY SWCV6041.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAL0030.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-IDRECONC-AUX          PIC 9(17).
           05 WS-IDRECONC              PIC X(17).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-IDRECONC.
              10 WS-IDRECONC-DATA      PIC X(06).
              10 WS-IDRECONC-SEQ       PIC 9(11).

           05 WS-DTRECONC              PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DTRECONC.
              10 FILLER                PIC X(02).
              10 WS-DTRECONC-ANT       PIC X(06).
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60402'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                         PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60402         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6040-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6040-ADE               TO SWCV6041-ADE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
                 THRU 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV6040-COSN EQUAL SPACES
              AND SWCV6040-COSNC EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6041-COSN-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-N-EXISTS  TO SWCV6041-COSN-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6041-COSN-CAPLIC
           END-IF.
      *
       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-APRESENTA-DADOS'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV6040-COSN              TO SWCV6041-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6040-COSNC             TO SWCV6041-COSNC.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO WS-DTRECONC
      *
           PERFORM 2210-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC
              THRU 2210-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE VIAL0030-NSEQUEN-1      TO WS-IDRECONC
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 COMPUTE WS-IDRECONC-AUX    = WS-DTRECONC
                                            * 10000000
                                            + 1
                 MOVE WS-IDRECONC-AUX      TO WS-IDRECONC
                 PERFORM 2220-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC
                    THRU 2220-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           MOVE WS-IDRECONC                TO SWCV6041-IDRECON
                                              SWCV6041-IDRECONC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO SWCV6041-DATAOPE.
      *
       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
       2210-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC.
      *****************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2210-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-ID-RECONC    TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-SOMA-1            TO TRUE.
      *
           CALL VIAL0030-ROTINA-SEQ
              USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                    VIAL0030-COMMAREA
           END-CALL.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2210-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *****************************************************************
       2220-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC.
      *****************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2220-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC '   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-ID-RECONC    TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-FORCA-VALOR       TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE WS-IDRECONC                TO VIAL0030-VALOR-ACUM.
      *
           CALL VIAL0030-ROTINA-SEQ
              USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                    VIAL0030-COMMAREA
           END-CALL.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *
       2220-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6041-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6041-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6041-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
      *
       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
